    "reason": "Actual full c21/2cf DE/EN supplied-data cases distinguish feedstock, samePE chemistry, per-useCO2e/land/water and actualcollection fromrecyclingyield.20/12g at20uses,50/42g at5uses; thresholds20/12 wholeuses. Whole3e9 plastic structure/thermal foundation suffices; no independenthydrolysis orPEcycle mastery is required. PP reuse/composite downstream cases similarly use actual suppliedyield/data. Whole8721removal is appropriate; no material/profile/image edit. Own current-context synthesis tmp/chemie-m7-resumed-20261016/HE-final-six-P-current-context-independent-a-v1/FIRST.own-final-six-P-current-context.before-record-serialization.json sha256:67ffb7e96e5c9abce5d06260753f92276d67c117a1d7071fe8d46e4785420cf6; original frozen whole-context science tmp/chemie-m7-resumed-20261016/HE-recycling-final-five-wholes-eight-views-independent-a-v1/FIRST.final-recycling-five-wholes-eight-views.independent-a.science.frozen.json sha256:c51f0d5bac70aabbdc2bc305bcbec02a10884cc6d1abe94e737f244db7c63f47. Whole profile/cases/criteria and unchanged actual resourcebytes retained. New own review identity/date bind the actual current requires/tags; no historical reviewer is reassigned. No new formalD/V/human/learner/whole-course acceptance is claimed.",
